  "out_of_scope_pending": [
    {
      "id": "8b977dd836",
      "reason": "Archmage范围外pending；RW1-SIB-01/02永久排除；248旧键blocked不纳入"
    },
    {
      "finding_id": "RW4-R1-OUT-01",
      "revision_key": "e433115e63be43b015cca379eadf2b0d75276411aabedf7c8c47ceebbbe1465d",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "accepted": false,
      "disposition": "out_of_scope_advisory",
      "fixed_source_commit": "624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63",
      "source_component": "tome",
      "public_source_path": "game/modules/tome/data/lore/elvala.lua",
      "line": 164,
      "source_excerpt": "I left my chamber then, dark thoughts now brooding at the back of my mind.  The date was coming closer when our plans would come to fruition and the Great Spellblaze would be unleashed.  A heavy foreboding lay over my heart.  Yet the alternatives seemed grim.  The war with the orcs was going badly, with few races able to secure their borders well and attacks from the brutes ever increasing.  Their numbers seemed inexhaustible.  Though they had little skill in warfare they could bring great harm to unprotected townsteads, and in enough force could bring down cities.  One human kingdom had collapsed under their attacks but a week before.  After that many who had initially rejected our plans came begging for our protection.  The Spellblaze seemed our only hope against imminent disaster.",
      "reason": "计划即将发动的阶段被改为提上日程；alternatives被改为命运，丢失其他选择同样严峻的关系。源码支持此具体观察。",
      "scope_reason": "该段164未在SPEC及原冻结edit_scope的138/154/158/174/186行对应段落内；首轮有界补充只新增原138/158段两个子句。164及其两处文字在本窗口所有候选相对baseline未改，不是本次引入的回归。保留为后续该条successor审核线索，不重开本窗口或宣称整篇无缺陷。"
    },
    {
      "finding_id": "RW4-FINAL-OUT-01",
      "revision_key": "e433115e63be43b015cca379eadf2b0d75276411aabedf7c8c47ceebbbe1465d",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "accepted": false,
      "disposition": "out_of_scope_advisory",
      "fixed_source_commit": "624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63",
      "source_component": "tome",
      "public_source_path": "game/modules/tome/data/lore/elvala.lua",
      "lines": [
        198,
        210
      ],
      "source_excerpts": [
        "He broke from his advisers as he saw us arrive, and strode towards us with a confident smile on his face.  Though he wore the grey robes of a research mage he still bore his great golden staff, Luminis, token of his position as king.",
        "He went with two of the senior research mages then to the front of the farportal.  They faced each other and began a low humming in unison, and slowly it seemed that the sparks from the farportal began to flicker redly.  Over the course of a few minutes their hum became a higher pitched chant, but softly sung and still in perfect unison.  As they raised their staffs there appeared above the farportal an image in flames, and looking at it both Neira and I marvelled, for we could see clearly that it was an image of ourselves, looking upwards, as if looking we were staring into a mirror.  Our features and movements were all clearly discernible, down the smallest detail, all carved out of flickering orange fire."
      ],
      "reason": "所引片段的research mage/senior research mages没有研究院命名；译文新增机构归属。高阶可含资历或层级，不能仅凭该措辞单独确认新增游戏阶位；该部分保留advisory，不扩大模型归因。",
      "scope_reason": "两处均位于本窗口138/154/158/174/186行所对应段落之外；与原baseline字样一致，不是本次引入。归入后续该条successor审核线索，不扩大本次局部修复。"
    }
  ],
